OL,3,GNEWSAAirlines criticise air traffic
OL,4,Acontrol after second glitch this month
OL,5,Acauses more disruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FAround 200 flights were cancelled or
OL,8,Fdid not fly today, says analytics firm
OL,9,FCirium - but passengers have been
OL,10,Fwarned they should not expect
OL,11,Fcompensation
OL,13,FEasyJet says this "once again calls
OL,14,Finto questions the resilience of Nats'
OL,15,Fsystems" - while trade body Airlines UK
OL,16,Fsays both passengers and airlines
OL,17,F"deserve better"
